      "Fix": "Add a half-beat of in-voice sensory or functional detail the first time \u0027Heloth construct\u0027 and \u0027Catalyst infusion/program\u0027 appear (as was done well for the toll and surcharge system) so a first-time reader can place them without inferring from later exposition."
