      "Fix": "Introduce any specialized capitalized system-term (e.g., \u0027Catalyst infusion,\u0027 \u0027Sinter,\u0027 \u0027Sinterkin\u0027) with a brief in-voice gloss the first time it appears, the same way the rule demands for acronyms, so a first-time reader isn\u0027t left inferring meaning from context alone."
